{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/39KNjWwLKyh0J0A8opCWsQ","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:56:56.953789+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/39KNjWwLKyh0J0A8opCWsQ","html":"<div><section><p><br/></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/JNwpw1lzEa0HibVDicgUFFMmKjtwvwtSeusFGPrHlkHoGAK1A9vCfy0L27Y8qIpM7kmNtW5mK0SAg6ZHTexibxXHg/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p>当前中国经济走到了需要各行各业更高质量发展阶段。特别是金融行业，对人才专业化程度的要求会越来越高。高金MF金融硕士项目紧扣市场，选拔金融人才，并倾力打造和培养。如果你具有以下特质，欢迎来申请高金MF金融硕士项目：</p><p>✔ 过硬专业素养</p><p>✔ Passion &amp; Driven，保持好奇心，敢于深入了解、用心探索</p><p>✔ 批判性思维，以批判性的眼光接纳更多可能性</p><p>✔ 虚怀若谷、勇于拼搏</p><p>在这个全球顶尖金融项目中，不仅能提升你的学术实力与实践能力，更能进一步拓宽你的全球金融视野，链接全球行业校友资源。</p><p><br/></p><p>上海高级金融学院（SAIF）金融硕士（MF）项目<strong>2025年明星营正式启动！ </strong> </p></section><p><br/></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong>01</strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><br/></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong>明星营时间安排 Event Calendar</strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/JNwpw1lzEa0HibVDicgUFFMmKjtwvwtSeuOgiaxHoR1S3jab4qicicxLPr6UIaibxF4l6FicB42WoaiakibUL8HyicnvcgNg/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section><section><p><em><span> * </span></em><span><em><span>以上活动如有任何时间及形式变动，SAIF MF将另作通知。</span></em></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong>02</strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><br/></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong>申请通道 Application Access</strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong>访问链接，开启网申</strong></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/JNwpw1lzEa0HibVDicgUFFMmKjtwvwtSeu7KYeEj70w1modXh5I9Pmia3CLBGCTPwFL9IM8VibdTYv2ZzQRdxpFo9g/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section><section><section><p><span><em><span>https://apply.saif.sjtu.edu.cn/user/login/saif/42</span></em></span></p></section></section></section></section><p><br/></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong>03</strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><br/></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong>解锁更多精彩内容 Stay Tuned for More</strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p>近期将有更多精彩内容，<strong>星标公众号</strong>，一手消息不错过：</p><ul><li><p>2026级推免招生简章</p></li><li><p>明星营全新升级揭秘</p></li><li><p>金融行业就业趋势分析<br/></p></li><li><p>丰富多彩的项目解读活动</p></li><li><p>校友、业界精彩分享</p></li></ul></section></section></section></section><p><br/></p><p><br/></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong>04</strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><br/></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong>听听你的声音 We are Listening </strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p>关于申请、保研、发展，扫码留下你想了解与关心的问题，我们将积极为你解答。</p></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/JNwpw1lzEa0HibVDicgUFFMmKjtwvwtSeu6mzsJEZwu9Uvs7hctYb1VOJwc2icvlnfO7MgqYnpiaJojFF2XtZSPlHQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section><p><br/></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong>05</strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><br/></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong>联系我们 Contact us</strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/JNwpw1lzEa0HibVDicgUFFMmKjtwvwtSeueNs1nicbETwniaOXXayibGK0uIsxowEichdpXjYn0cqbuR8rDQnC5HFsCA/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/6LiaEAplUaanFeS6TE1DdZGZuJWyRJuLXmwkx4xxU6WHqefM9gibnBteEWaycUKDHsDasxM6nNJZfTtoql8wxHQg/640?wx_fmt=gif\"/></section></section></section><section><p><br/></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><br/></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong>交大高金金融硕士 SAIF MF</strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><br/></p><section><p>金融硕士(Master of Finance，简称 MF)是项目作为上海交通大学上海高级金融学院（交大高金/SAIF）的旗舰项目，自2009年创立以来，一直以专业化、国际化、市场化为办学特色，项目采用两年全日制，全英文教学模式，并直接引进世界级名校的一流师资。毕业生平均起薪连年逆势增长，就业率始终保持在100%。交大高金金融硕士项目设置金融方向（MF-General）与金融科技方向（MF-FinTech）两大培养方向，拥有前沿尖端的课程设置、国际视野的教学结构、密切深度的业界实践，与国际全面接轨。</p><p><br/></p><p>在2024年英国《金融时报》金融硕士排名中，交大高金金融硕士项目跻身全球前8，其中职业发展服务位居亚洲第1，再创佳绩；并于2017年起，连续三届蝉联亚洲第一。目前，SAIF MF被视为亚洲最负盛名的金融项目之一。</p></section><p><br/></p><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong>金融硕士金融方向</strong></p><p><strong>(MF-General Track)</strong></p></section></section></section><section><p><br/></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong>培养金融业顶尖专业人才</strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><br/></p></section><section><p>金融方向自2009年开创，课程设计框架对标美国麻省理工学院，结合国内外金融市场发展，不断对课程进行优化与改良。以经典、硬核、与时俱进著称的金融方向，覆盖财务会计、金融市场、衍生品等课程，毕业生去向包括投行与咨询、投资、投研、销售交易等方向。<strong>我们欢迎金融经管，有实习经验，中英文交流能力等软技能比较强的同学报名；金融方向也特别欢迎各类理工科，医科背景，想转金融方向，具有上述很强软技能的优秀人才报考。</strong></p></section></section></section><p><br/></p><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong>金融硕士金融科技方向</strong></p><p><strong>(MF-FinTech Track)</strong></p></section></section></section><section><p><br/></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong>培养金融业顶尖复合人才</strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><br/></p></section><section><p>课程设置专注于金融、机器学习和计算机技术和应用三个方面。金融科技方向 (MF-FinTech Track) 专业<strong>仅招收有很强数理和计算机背景的学生，特别是以下本科专业：数学，应用数学，统计和数据科学，自动化，计算机和人工智能，金融工程，数理经济，物理，电子工程等；经济、金融专业申请金融科技方向，需要辅修上述的专业作为第二专业或额外提供很强数理背景材料</strong>。曾在全国中学生奥林匹克数、理、计算机竞赛或国际大学生数学、计算机和建模竞赛获奖的同学会更具申请与录取优势。</p></section></section></section><p><br/></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong>推荐阅读</strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><br/></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/mp/appmsgalbum?__biz=MjM5NDQ3NjA1MA==&amp;action=getalbum&amp;album_id=2921132749137346565#wechat_redirect\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/mp/appmsgalbum?__biz=MjM5NDQ3NjA1MA==&amp;action=getalbum&amp;album_id=2921132749137346565#wechat_redirect\"><section><section><span><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/JNwpw1lzEa0HibVDicgUFFMmKjtwvwtSeuDn9trSydLVoRAbMPVMZodXWq1QZG37ia3icIicdyEQ1fJV8YBCydzgthw/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></span></section></section></a></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong>合集 | 高金MF学生校友故事</strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>▲ 点击图片查看原文</span><br/></p></section></section><p><br/></p></section><p></p></div>","textSha256":"f0d4aa5ab914e5d283534b42ac2cd58dd7e14851e962d9ff93086e306b740ba6","textLength":1470,"sourceSha256":"adea819cf618952e500dc7f7beb1ee157358aecada80ae835a4b6c6ff1e1b436","selector":"#js_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-9c5c7b7dde0bee4a8af4","title":"2025年上海交通大学上海高级金融学院金融硕士2025年明星营启动","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:56:56.953789+00:00"}
